      "title": "Inclusive Accessibility",
      "subtitle": "We are the only graphic editor with accessibility to ensure that anyone can create, regardless of how they see the world.",
      "description": "Accessibility is not just a feature; it is a social commitment. Globally, there are about 43 million blind people. In Brazil, this number exceeds 580,000 people, part of a group of more than 6.5 million with severe visual impairment, according to IBGE. Mosca Tee was designed to break these barriers, ensuring that professional design is everyone's territory, without exceptions.",
